id=liuqin_boot_ubuntu
name=Boot to Ubuntu (liuqin)
version=v0.3
versionCode=3
author=xiaomipad-6pro-mainline
description=One button that writes the mainline Ubuntu boot image into boot_a and restarts the tablet (both systems boot from slot A), and a boot-time guard that disables the Android system updater so that an OTA cannot rewrite slot B. Ships the switcher only; the boot images live on the Ubuntu root filesystem.
